Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Exclude Android.bp files, built via aospext/meson instead

Rename Android.bp -> Android.bp_ so Soong doesn't see duplicate modules
next to the copy in external/. Same approach as GloDroid's drm_hwcomposer
patch 0010.
---
 Android.bp => Android.bp_           | 0
 backend/{Android.bp => Android.bp_} | 0
 tests/{Android.bp => Android.bp_}   | 0
 3 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 rename Android.bp => Android.bp_ (100%)
 rename backend/{Android.bp => Android.bp_} (100%)
 rename tests/{Android.bp => Android.bp_} (100%)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp_
similarity index 100%
rename from Android.bp
rename to Android.bp_
diff --git a/backend/Android.bp b/backend/Android.bp_
similarity index 100%
rename from backend/Android.bp
rename to backend/Android.bp_
diff --git a/tests/Android.bp b/tests/Android.bp_
similarity index 100%
rename from tests/Android.bp
rename to tests/Android.bp_
